{"body": "Context:\nWhen writing data to parquet, the data could be in memory buffer, encoded as page, or in mixed state. The size of in memory data could be much larger than encoded page. The row group size could be even smaller after the final compression.\nThis makes it difficult to estimate the current row group size, and result in creating much smaller row-group than write.parquet.row-group-size-bytes config\nFix:\nUse the previous in memory vs written ratios to make estimation on current row group\nTesting:\nWriting 50 columns with 1MB row group size, using columnName + i as data\n(wide columns and small row group size can reduce the chance of encoding happens)\nBefore fix:\nBlock 1 compressed size: 30792\nBlock 2 compressed size: 30793\nBlock 3 compressed size: 30791\nBlock 4 compressed size: 30935\nBlock 5 compressed size: 30838\nBlock 6 compressed size: 30825\nBlock 7 compressed size: 30843\nBlock 8 compressed size: 30839\n\nAfter fix:\nBlock 1 compressed size: 1007783\nBlock 2 compressed size: 1051313\nBlock 3 compressed size: 1056900\nBlock 4 compressed size: 1056199\nBlock 5 compressed size: 1059470\nBlock 6 compressed size: 1058124\nBlock 7 compressed size: 1060285\nBlock 8 compressed size: 1057551", "date": "2024-10-04T16:53:23Z", "hash": "sha256:2c8ef36c7c92fd4f0c20", "id": "gh:apache/iceberg#11258", "meta": {"additions": 77, "association": "NONE", "base": "main", "comments": 21, "deletions": 9, "draft": false, "files": ["core/src/test/java/org/apache/iceberg/TestMetrics.java", "parquet/src/main/java/org/apache/iceberg/parquet/ParquetWriter.java", "parquet/src/test/java/org/apache/iceberg/parquet/TestParquet.java", "spark/v3.5/spark/src/test/java/org/apache/iceberg/spark/actions/TestRewriteDataFilesAction.java"], "labels": ["spark", "parquet", "core", "not-stale"], "last_commit": "2024-10-09T22:14:22Z", "n_files": 4, "number": 11258, "repo": "apache/iceberg", "requested": ["amogh-jahagirdar"], "reviews": [{"at": "2024-10-08T00:15:12Z", "by": "jinyangli34", "state": "COMMENTED"}, {"at": "2024-10-08T15:23:54Z", "by": "edgarRd", "state": "COMMENTED"}, {"at": "2024-10-08T19:54:41Z", "by": "Parth-Brahmbhatt", "state": "APPROVED"}, {"at": "2024-10-08T20:39:10Z", "by": "RussellSpitzer", "state": "COMMENTED"}, {"at": "2024-10-08T20:49:24Z", "by": "RussellSpitzer", "state": "COMMENTED"}, {"at": "2024-10-08T20:50:39Z", "by": "RussellSpitzer", "state": "COMMENTED"}, {"at": "2024-10-08T20:50:48Z", "by": "RussellSpitzer", "state": "COMMENTED"}, {"at": "2024-10-08T20:53:22Z", "by": "RussellSpitzer", "state": "COMMENTED"}, {"at": "2024-10-09T05:18:14Z", "by": "jinyangli34", "state": "COMMENTED"}, {"at": "2024-10-09T05:41:34Z", "by": "jinyangli34", "state": "COMMENTED"}, {"at": "2024-10-21T19:47:11Z", "by": "RussellSpitzer", "state": "COMMENTED"}, {"at": "2024-10-22T07:07:47Z", "by": "nastra", "state": "COMMENTED"}, {"at": "2024-10-22T07:13:11Z", "by": "nastra", "state": "COMMENTED"}, {"at": "2024-10-22T07:13:58Z", "by": "nastra", "state": "COMMENTED"}, {"at": "2024-10-22T21:58:29Z", "by": "jinyangli34", "state": "COMMENTED"}, {"at": "2024-10-22T21:59:05Z", "by": "jinyangli34", "state": "COMMENTED"}, {"at": "2024-10-22T22:04:43Z", "by": "jinyangli34", "state": "COMMENTED"}, {"at": "2024-10-23T07:37:44Z", "by": "nastra", "state": "COMMENTED"}, {"at": "2024-10-23T10:30:35Z", "by": "nastra", "state": "COMMENTED"}, {"at": "2024-10-23T18:29:24Z", "by": "jinyangli34", "state": "COMMENTED"}], "state": "open", "thumbs_up": 0, "updated_at": "2024-11-25T07:33:15Z"}, "people": ["jinyangli34"], "refs": [], "source": "github", "title": "More accurate estimate on parquet row groups size", "type": "pr", "url": "https://github.com/apache/iceberg/pull/11258"}
{"body": "closes #11023\nThis PR adds a new table property io.client-side.purge-enabled. It allows a catalog to control spark's behavior on DROP .. PURGE. This in turn, enables  REST catalogs to offer an UNDROP feature for all storage providers. Currently, this is only possible with s3 due to the s3.delete_enabled property.", "date": "2024-10-14T09:18:37Z", "hash": "sha256:0223deb52854de1cdfd9", "id": "gh:apache/iceberg#11317", "meta": {"additions": 174, "association": "NONE", "base": "main", "closes": [11023], "comments": 17, "deletions": 0, "draft": false, "files": ["core/src/main/java/org/apache/iceberg/CachingCatalog.java", "core/src/main/java/org/apache/iceberg/CatalogProperties.java", "spark/v3.5/spark/src/main/java/org/apache/iceberg/spark/SparkCatalog.java", "spark/v3.5/spark/src/test/java/org/apache/iceberg/spark/sql/TestRestDropPurgeTable.java"], "labels": ["spark", "core", "not-stale"], "last_commit": "2024-11-04T19:20:01Z", "n_files": 4, "number": 11317, "repo": "apache/iceberg", "reviews": [{"at": "2024-10-14T17:05:10Z", "by": "RussellSpitzer", "state": "COMMENTED"}, {"at": "2024-10-25T14:37:16Z", "by": "RussellSpitzer", "state": "COMMENTED"}, {"at": "2024-10-25T15:19:52Z", "by": "RussellSpitzer", "state": "COMMENTED"}, {"at": "2024-11-04T23:24:53Z", "by": "RussellSpitzer", "state": "COMMENTED"}, {"at": "2024-11-05T08:10:09Z", "by": "nastra", "state": "COMMENTED"}, {"at": "2024-11-05T08:12:02Z", "by": "nastra", "state": "COMMENTED"}, {"at": "2024-11-05T11:41:45Z", "by": "twuebi", "state": "COMMENTED"}, {"at": "2024-11-23T15:27:20Z", "by": "twuebi", "state": "COMMENTED"}, {"at": "2024-11-25T11:36:36Z", "by": "nastra", "state": "COMMENTED"}, {"at": "2024-11-25T16:33:58Z", "by": "RussellSpitzer", "state": "COMMENTED"}, {"at": "2024-12-09T09:40:34Z", "by": "twuebi", "state": "COMMENTED"}, {"at": "2024-12-09T15:57:54Z", "by": "sfc-gh-rspitzer", "state": "COMMENTED"}, {"at": "2024-12-11T23:52:08Z", "by": "rdblue", "state": "COMMENTED"}, {"at": "2024-12-11T23: